From: buntOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pwm: mediatek,pwm-disp: add MT6897

The display PWM of MT6897 has the registers of the MT8183 one. The driver
of the stock kernel of the Lenovo TB375FC has the same values for both.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,pwm-disp.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,pwm-disp.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,pwm-disp.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,pwm-disp.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pwm/mediatek,pwm-disp.yaml
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
       - items:
           - enum:
               - mediatek,mt6893-disp-pwm
+              - mediatek,mt6897-disp-pwm
               - mediatek,mt8186-disp-pwm
               - mediatek,mt8188-disp-pwm
               - mediatek,mt8192-disp-pwm
